  - **Destination (canonical):** Slack list **https://cardinalityproject.slack.com/lists/T0C37AFKSJE/F0C35F6198W** — Workspace **T0C37AFKSJE** (**https://app.slack.com/client/T0C37AFKSJE**), List ID **F0C35F6198W**. These IDs/URLs are Rich-provided (not secrets); do not invent other list IDs, channel IDs, bot tokens, or credentials.
  - **Hard rule:** the claimable pick-up task **must** be the list record. Do **not** use **#project-solution** (or any other channel) **messages** as the pick-up task surface. An optional brief channel notice that **points at** the list record is OK; it does not replace the list item.
